</video></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class="ltx-section"><div class="padding-global"><div class="padding-section-12rem"><div class="w-layout-grid _2columns-grid cc-40-60"><div class="left-90"><div data-wf--section-name-eyebrow--variant="light" class="section-name-new w-variant-fe0ea1ca-1149-4d6c-7843-bb339f668b26"><div class="text-scramble">//</div><p class="section-name">Introducing</p></div><div class="spacer-2rem"></div><h2 class="heading-style-h1 is-bold">Diffusion Fidelity Rendering</h2><div class="spacer-1rem"></div><p class="intro-paragraph is-balanced">A new video generation technology that allocates rendering compute by scene complexity, delivering industry-leading pixel quality that holds up frame by frame, even on a cinema screen.</p><div class="spacer-2rem"></div><div class="buttons-wrap2"><a href="https://ltx.io/forms/onboarding" data-theme-exclude="" data-cta-navigation="https://ltx.io/forms/onboarding" data-analytics-prop-location="model_cap_section" data-wf--ltx-but-white--variant="light" target="_blank" class="ltx-but-base is-white w-variant-fe2e6d0c-7246-22fd-957c-36dbe4f1dcd4 a-cta w-button">Try LTX-2.5 Now</a><link rel="prefetch" href="https://ltx.io/forms/onboarding"/></div></div><div class="feature-card-wrap with-video-controls is-capability"><div class="video-controls-wrapper cc-hide"><div class="play-button_wrapper is-model"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6950e870934bb3527e4841a0_Play-icon.svg" alt="" class="play"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6950e870b6c982850fda2cbc_mute-icon-2.svg" alt="" class="pause"/></div></div><div class="video-facade"><img sizes="(max-width: 479px) 48vw, (max-width: 991px) 49vw, 50vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7b19f105c81804b0f59361_DFR_1_frame-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7b19f105c81804b0f59361_DFR_1_frame-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7b19f105c81804b0f59361_DFR_1_frame-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7b19f105c81804b0f59361_DFR_1_frame-p-1600.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7b19f105c81804b0f59361_DFR_1_frame.avif 1920w" alt="LTX-2.5 Diffusion Fidelity Rendering Video" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7b19f105c81804b0f59361_DFR_1_frame.avif" loading="lazy" class="feature-poster-img-3"/></div><div class="video-container with-sound"><div class="feature-card-video w-embed"><video
