e"></div></div></div><div role="tab" data-tabs="content-item" class="hover-tab-text__item"><div class="hover-tab__ttl"><div class="heading-style-h4 is-grey">03</div><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Better prompt adherence</h3></div><div data-tabs="item-details" class="hover-tab__detail"><div class="spacer-1rem _0-5-on-mobile"></div><p class="text-size-medium is-capability">Follow complex creative instructions from shorter, simpler prompts.</p><div class="spacer-1rem _0-5-on-mobile"></div></div></div><div role="tab" data-tabs="content-item" class="hover-tab-text__item"><div class="hover-tab__ttl"><div class="heading-style-h4 is-grey">04</div><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Auto duration</h3></div><div data-tabs="item-details" class="hover-tab__detail"><div class="spacer-1rem _0-5-on-mobile"></div><p class="text-size-medium is-capability">Generate the right clip length for the requested action.</p><div class="spacer-1rem _0-5-on-mobile"></div></div></div><div role="tab" data-tabs="content-item" class="hover-tab-text__item"><div class="hover-tab__ttl"><div class="heading-style-h4 is-grey">07</div><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Better results, less compute</h3></div><div data-tabs="item-details" class="hover-tab__detail"><div class="spacer-1rem _0-5-on-mobile"></div><p class="text-size-medium is-capability">Get near-full-model quality with fewer retries, fewer controls, and significantly lower compute.</p><div class="spacer-1rem _0-5-on-mobile"></div></div></div><div role="tab" data-tabs="content-item" class="hover-tab-text__item"><div class="hover-tab__ttl"><div class="heading-style-h4 is-grey">08</div><h3 class="heading-style-h4">A pretrained foundation you can fine-tune </h3></div><div data-tabs="item-details" class="hover-tab__detail"><div class="spacer-1rem _0-5-on-mobile"></div><p class="text-size-medium is-capability">Fine-tune a raw foundation model on your own data and domain.</p><div class="spacer-1rem _0-5-on-mobile"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hover-tabs-new-column"><div role="tabpanel" data-tabs="visual-item" class="hover-tabs-asset-wrap"><div class="feature-card-wrap with-video-controls is-capability"><div class="video-controls-wrapper cc-hide"><div class="play-button_wrapper is-model"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6950e870934bb3527e4841a0_Play-icon.svg" alt="" class="play"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6950e870b6c982850fda2cbc_mute-icon-2.svg" alt="" class="pause"/></div></div><div class="video-facade"><img sizes="(max-width: 1919px) 100vw, 1920px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7a33adf1c340c52bc8d0da_LX-Release25-Capabilities-01-Motion_frame-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7a33adf1c340c52bc8d0da_LX-Release25-Capabilities-01-Motion_frame-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7a33adf1c340c52bc8d0da_LX-Release25-Capabilities-01-Motion_frame-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7a33adf1c340c52bc8d0da_LX-Release25-Capabilities-01-Motion_frame.avif 1920w" alt="LTX-2.5 Cleaner Motion Video" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7a33adf1c340c52bc8d0da_LX-Release25-Capabilities-01-Motion_frame.avif" loading="lazy" class="feature-poster-img-3"/></div><div class="video-container with-sound"><div class="feature-card-video w-embed"><video
