</video></div></div></div><div class="what-changed-card"><p class="text-size-medium is-capability"><strong>What changed:</strong> Improved distilled model, larger dataset + RL, prompt enhancement, and automatic duration prediction.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" data-tabs="visual-item" class="hover-tabs-asset-wrap"><div class="feature-card-wrap with-video-controls is-capability"><div class="video-controls-wrapper cc-hide"><div class="play-button_wrapper is-model"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6950e870934bb3527e4841a0_Play-icon.svg" alt="" class="play"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6950e870b6c982850fda2cbc_mute-icon-2.svg" alt="" class="pause"/></div></div><div class="video-facade"><img sizes="(max-width: 1919px) 100vw, 1920px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7a2272ba5032e1faaca879_LX-Release25-Capabilities-08-Pretrained_frame-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7a2272ba5032e1faaca879_LX-Release25-Capabilities-08-Pretrained_frame-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7a2272ba5032e1faaca879_LX-Release25-Capabilities-08-Pretrained_frame-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7a2272ba5032e1faaca879_LX-Release25-Capabilities-08-Pretrained_frame.avif 1920w" alt="LTX-2.5 Fine Tune Video" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/6a7a2272ba5032e1faaca879_LX-Release25-Capabilities-08-Pretrained_frame.avif" loading="lazy" class="feature-poster-img-3"/></div><div class="video-container with-sound"><div class="feature-card-video w-embed"><video
  class="lazy-load feature-video-src"
  preload="none"
  muted
