</video></div></div></div><div class="layout-grid__card-details"><p data-layout-grid-item-title="" class="heading-style-h5">CRT LoRA</p><p class="text-size-regular cc-limit">Renders video in a late-80s CRT monitor look — scanlines, phosphor glow, choppy motion.</p><div class="by-username-wrap"><div class="text-size-regular">By</div><div class="text-size-regular text-weight-semibold">lovis93</div></div></div></a><link rel="prefetch" href="https://huggingface.co/lovis93/crt-animation-terminal-ltx-2.3-lora"/></div><div data-layout-grid-item="" role="listitem" class="layout-grid__item w-dyn-item"><a href="https://huggingface.co/TheBurgstall/ltx-2.3-bodypositivity-lora" target="_blank" class="layout-grid__card w-inline-block"><div class="feature-card-wrap with-video-controls is-capability"><div class="video-facade"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c6ddbeb26cbd692adc0291/6a312f5c0af72065c80236e9_bodyPositivity-cover_frame.avif" alt="" class="feature-poster-img-3"/></div><div class="video-container with-sound"><div class="feature-card-video w-embed"><video
