</video></div></div></div><div class="layout-grid__card-details"><p data-layout-grid-item-title="" class="heading-style-h5">Googly Eyes LoRA</p><p class="text-size-regular cc-limit">Slaps oversized googly-eye stickers onto any subject in an LTX-2.3 generation. Trigger with googlyeyes.</p><div class="by-username-wrap"><div class="text-size-regular">By</div><div class="text-size-regular text-weight-semibold">TheBurgstall</div></div></div></a><link rel="prefetch" href="https://huggingface.co/TheBurgstall/ltx-2.3-googlyeyes-lora"/></div></div></div></div><div class="resizable-grid-sizing w-embed"><style>
/* ===== Layout grid flip: columns & gaps ===== */
[data-layout-status="large"] {
  --columns: 3;
  --column-gap: 1.5em;
}

[data-layout-status="small"] {
  --columns: 5;
  --column-gap: 1em;
}

[data-layout-grid-item] {
  width: calc((100% - (var(--columns) - 1) * var(--column-gap)) / var(--columns));
}

[data-layout-grid-item-title] {
  transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.1, 1);
}

/* Card tweaks — large (grid) mode */
[data-layout-status="large"] [data-layout-grid-item] .layout-grid__card-sub {
  transition-delay: 0.6s;
}

/* Card tweaks — small (dense) mode */
[data-layout-status="small"] [data-layout-grid-item] .layout-grid__card-title {
  font-size: 1em;
}

[data-layout-status="small"] [data-layout-grid-item] .layout-grid__card-sub {
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
}


/* ===== Line clamp utility ===== */
.cc-limit {
  --lines: 2;
  display: -webkit-box;
  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
  -webkit-line-clamp: var(--lines);
  line-clamp: var(--lines);
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.cc-limit.cc-1 { --lines: 1; }
.cc-limit.cc-3 { --lines: 3; }


/* ===== Desktop hover focus: dim + blur non-hovered cards ===== */
@media screen and (min-width: 992px) and (hover: hover) {
  [data-layout-grid-item] {
    transition: opacity .3s ease, filter .3s ease;
  }

  [data-layout-grid-list][data-hover-active] [data-layout-grid-item]:not([data-hover-current]) {
    opacity: .5;
    filter: blur(2px);
  }

  /* Never blur mid Flip transition — filter creates a containing block */
  [data-layout-group][data-transitioning] [data-layout-grid-item] {
    filter: none !important;
  }
}


/* ===== Breakpoint overrides ===== */

/* Tablet only — 4 columns in small mode */
@media screen and (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px) {
  [data-layout-status="small"] {
    --columns: 4;
  }
}

/* Mobile */
@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
  [data-layout-status="large"] {
    --columns: 1;
    --column-gap: 0em;
  }

  [data-layout-status="small"] {
    --columns: 2;
    --column-gap: 1em;
  }
}
</style></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-footer-wrap"><div class="section-faq cc-light"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-90rem"><div class="padding-section-8rem"><div class="faq-wrap"><div data-wf--section-name-eyebrow--variant="light" class="section-name-new w-variant-fe0ea1ca-1149-4d6c-7843-bb339f668b26"><div class="text-scramble">//</div><p class="section-name">FAQs</p></div><div class="faq-list"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="faq-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7f809f9f-d03e-003f-f514-9a5db72b4328" class="dark-faq-wrapper"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="faq-trigger-v2"><h3 class="faq-question-hp">What is LTX-2.5?</h3><div class="open-close-button cc-height"><div class="open-close-wrapper center"><div class="open-close-line-2 cc-white"></div><div class="open-close-line-2 second-line cc-white"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper-2"><div class="faq-answer-inner-wrap-2"><div class="faq-answer-new w-richtext"><p>LTX-2.5 is the newest version of LTX, an open-weights world model for video generation. It&#x27;s built as a stronger foundation, not just a new tool, that teams can build on, fine-tune, and deploy themselves.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7f809f9f-d03e-003f-f514-9a5db72b4328" class="dark-faq-wrapper"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="faq-trigger-v2"><h3 class="faq-question-hp">What&#x27;s new in LTX-2.5?</h3><div class="open-close-button cc-height"><div class="open-close-wrapper center"><div class="open-close-line-2 cc-white"></div><div class="open-close-line-2 second-line cc-white"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper-2"><div class="faq-answer-inner-wrap-2"><div class="faq-answer-new w-richtext"><p>It adds a better video decoder for cleaner motion, native multi-shot scenes that stay consistent across cuts, stronger prompt understanding, automatic clip duration, beta precise video editing, native 4K HDR and RAW support, and a faster, higher-quality distilled model.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7f809f9f-d03e-003f-f514-9a5db72b4328" class="dark-faq-wrapper"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="faq-trigger-v2"><h3 class="faq-question-hp">Can I fine-tune LTX-2.5 on my own data?</h3><div class="open-close-button cc-height"><div class="open-close-wrapper center"><div class="open-close-line-2 cc-white"></div><div class="open-close-line-2 second-line cc-white"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper-2"><div class="faq-answer-inner-wrap-2"><div class="faq-answer-new w-richtext"><p>Yes. LTX-2.5 includes a pretrained base checkpoint built specifically for fine-tuning, so you can adapt it to your own domain and deploy it on your own infrastructure.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7f809f9f-d03e-003f-f514-9a5db72b4328" class="dark-faq-wrapper"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="faq-trigger-v2"><h3 class="faq-question-hp">How fast is LTX-2.5?</h3><div class="open-close-button cc-height"><div class="open-close-wrapper center"><div class="open-close-line-2 cc-white"></div><div class="open-close-line-2 second-line cc-white"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper-2"><div class="faq-answer-inner-wrap-2"><div class="faq-answer-new w-richtext"><p>Self-hosted on 2× GB200 GPUs at 720p, LTX-2.5 generates a 10-second video clip in 6.8 seconds, which is faster than real time.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7f809f9f-d03e-003f-f514-9a5db72b4328" class="dark-faq-wrapper"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="faq-trigger-v2"><h3 class="faq-question-hp">What does the LTX-2.5 API cost?</h3><div class="open-close-button cc-height"><div class="open-close-wrapper center"><div class="open-close-line-2 cc-white"></div><div class="open-close-line-2 second-line cc-white"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper-2"><div class="faq-answer-inner-wrap-2"><div class="faq-answer-new w-richtext"><p>API pricing is billed per second of generated video. ltx-2-5-fast: $0.09/sec at 720p, $0.13/sec at 1080p, $0.19/sec at 1440p, and $0.30/sec at 4K. ltx-2-5-pro: $0.12/sec at 720p and $0.17/sec at 1080p. Full rates are on the <a href="https://docs.ltx.io/pricing">API pricing page</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7f809f9f-d03e-003f-f514-9a5db72b4328" class="dark-faq-wrapper"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="faq-trigger-v2"><h3 class="faq-question-hp">What are the licensing terms for LTX-2.5?</h3><div class="open-close-button cc-height"><div class="open-close-wrapper center"><div class="open-close-line-2 cc-white"></div><div class="open-close-line-2 second-line cc-white"></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper-2"><div class="faq-answer-inner-wrap-2"><div class="faq-answer-new w-richtext"><p>LTX-2.5 uses open weights with a permissive license, no mandatory branding, and free use under $10M ARR.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-theme-exclude="" data-wf--breadcrumbs-component--variant="light" class="breadcrumb-section-1 w-variant-4d9db035-fc30-bb04-1ca5-23fd21a24427"><div class="padding-global w-variant-4d9db035-fc30-bb04-1ca5-23fd21a24427"><div class="container-90rem"><div class="breadcrumb_component w-variant-4d9db035-fc30-bb04-1ca5-23fd21a24427"><div class="breadcrubms-links-animation w-embed"><style>
.ltx-breadcrubms-link {
  position: relative;
  text-decoration: none !important; /* Remove default underline */
}

.ltx-breadcrubms-link::after {
  content: '';
  display: block;
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: -2px;         /* 2px offset from text bottom */
  height: 1px;          /* 1px thick */
  width: 100%;
  background: currentColor;     /* Adjust color as needed */
  transform: scaleX(0); /* Start hidden */
  transform-origin: left;
  transition: transform 0.25s ease; /* Calm, no bounce */
}

.ltx-breadcrubms-link:hover::after,
.ltx-breadcrubms-link:focus::after {
  transform: scaleX(1);
}
</style></div><a href="/" class="ltx-breadcrubms-link">Home</a><link rel="prefetch" href="/"/><div class="breadcrumb-divider w-embed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6 3L11 8L6 13" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
</svg></div><div class="ltx-breadcrubms-current-page">LTX-2.5</div></div></div></div></div></div><section data-wf--footer-section-black--variant="base" class="footer-section cc-ltx"><div class="footer-links-animation w-embed"><!-- ✅ START: Footer link underline -->
<style>
  /* Draws animated underline for footer links.
     Secondary footer links use their own text color for the underline. */

  .ltx-footer-link {
    position: relative;
    text-decoration: none !important;
  }

  .ltx-footer-link::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: -2px;
    height: 1px;
    width: 100%;
    background: #fff;
    transform: scaleX(0);
    transform-origin: left;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ltx-footer-link:hover::after,
  .ltx-footer-link:focus::after {
    transform: scaleX(1);
  }

  /* Secondary footer links: underline matches grey text color */
  .ltx-footer-link.is-secondary::after {
    background: currentColor;
  }
</style>
<!-- ✅ END: Footer link underline --></div><div class="footer-theme-exclude w-embed w-script"><!-- ✅ START: Footer-only theme exclude -->
<script>
  /* Adds data-theme-exclude="true" only inside the footer component where this embed is placed.
     document.currentScript is captured before DOMContentLoaded (it is null inside the listener),
     and the footer is matched with or without the Shared Library ltx-- prefix. */
  (function () {
    const currentScript = document.currentScript;
    const FOOTER_SELECTOR = '.footer-section, .ltx--footer-section';

    function markFooter() {
      const footer =
        (currentScript && (currentScript.closest(FOOTER_SELECTOR) || currentScript.closest('footer'))) ||
        document.querySelector(FOOTER_SELECTOR);

      if (!footer) return;

      footer.setAttribute('data-theme-exclude', 'true');
      footer.querySelectorAll('*').forEach((element) => {
        element.setAttribute('data-theme-exclude', 'true');
      });
    }

    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', markFooter);
    } else {
      markFooter();
    }
  })();
</script>
<!-- ✅ END: Footer-only theme exclude -->
</div><div class="w-layout-vflex footer-big-wrap-new"><div class="w-layout-hflex footer-grid-wrap-new"><div class="footer-wrap"><div class="div-block-345"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68872d15af29880764eac4aa/69445617becf4761ee3d478b_ltx-logo.svg" alt="LTX" class="footer-logo"/><div class="spacer-1rem cc-hide-on-mobile"></div><div class="cc-outro cc-outro-parent text-balanced">Open foundation models for video, audio, and world simulation</div><div class="spacer-2rem cc-1-5-on-mobile"></div><div><a data-theme-exclude="true" data-cta-navigation="https://console.ltx.io/playground" data-analytics-prop-location="footer" data-wf--ltx-but-flex-outline--variant="base" data-w-id="beec3a73-7264-363a-8b24-0242026757c3" href="https://console.ltx.io/playground" class="ltx-but-flex is-text is-outline a-cta w-inline-block"><div class="copy-inside-but">Try LTX Now</div><div class="menu-arrow-wrap cc-v2"><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall-2 cc-hover w-embed"><svg width="15" height="10" viewBox="0 0 15 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
